## Results

| Metric | Value |
|--------|:-----:|
| 799 real queries coverage | **99.9%** |
| Rule table alone | **86.5%** |
| Adversarial queries (58) | **67%** |
| Avg latency | **~11ms** |
| External dependencies | **0** |

